Package: oocgroup
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign CGROUP MANAGER
 Creates and configures cgroup v2 resource limits for memory, cpu, and io controllers.
 Pure openOODA utility with zero ambient authority, terminal ergonomics,
 and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
